    "title": "Campaign level 1 at normal speed, pp1Roles on",
    "description": "The experiment half of issue #720's matched pair: campaign level 1, seed 1, the scripted player, with issue #358's PP1 role-first ordnance matrix applied (?pp1Roles=1). The whole round of the real application at wall-clock pace, from the end of the round-start countdown to the last frame before the outcome panel (under a 60 s ceiling), recorded from the compositor and resampled to 30 fps. The page runs its production game loop; nothing steps the simulation. Needs a build that names its commit (VITE_BUILD_SHA) and a host GPU for the delivered-rate gate.",
    "altText": "One whole round of the scripted player fighting the level 1 roster under the PP1 role budgets, seen from the game camera."
  },
